  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising latent likelihood of violent escalation lowers investor risk appetite for capital‑intensive, long‑horizon AI bets as market participants reprice geopolitical tail risks, potential demand shocks, and interruption exposure.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_escalation</data>
