  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising overall escalation pressure elevates national-security concerns that prompt regulators to adopt stricter data, cybersecurity, and cross-border transaction rules, increasing regulatory restrictiveness affecting tech and finance tied to China.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_escalation</data>
