  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising military escalation raises geopolitical and commodity-risk premia (and perceived fiscal/tail risks), prompting investors to demand higher yields on benchmark government debt.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_escalation</data>
  <data key="d40">global_market_repricing</data>
