  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">A rising aggregate tendency toward US–Iran escalation signals US political and operational constraints and the need to avoid broader confrontation, which reduces Moscow's perceived risk of punitive escalation by the US/partners and thereby lowers perceived deterrence in the Russia‑Ukraine context.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
