  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">An uptick in active conventional strikes near infrastructure elevates insurance premiums and perceived construction/operational risk, causing lenders and equity providers to charge higher all‑in financing costs for new data‑centre projects.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_escalation</data>
