  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained uptick in kinetic operations raises defense and resilience priorities, driving governments to redirect public investment and subsidies into strategic tech sectors (e.g., semiconductors, secure comms) that increase state-directed investment competition with Chinese firms.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
