  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained uptick in US/Iran kinetic operations forces the United States and partners to reallocate munitions, air‑to‑air/strike stocks, and fast‑moving logistics to the Middle East, directly reducing the rate and continuity of weapons and munitions shipments available for Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
