  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Operational lessons from Russia's battlefield use of advanced electronics and munitions prompt Western and allied policymakers to accelerate and direct public investment into domestic semiconductor, microelectronics and defense supply chains to reduce strategic dependence on rival suppliers including China.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
