  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A clearer perception of credible deterrence lowers the assessed probability of kinetic or targeted attacks on critical infrastructure, leading lenders to demand smaller risk premia on data‑centre loans and bonds.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
