  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.78</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising perceived legal, operational, and reputational risk for foreign firms operating in the market leads banks and bond investors to add a higher risk premium to loans and bonds for data‑centre projects, widening credit spreads.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
