  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A tightening of monetary policy raises banks' funding costs and reduces central-bank liquidity/backstop support, which directly increases loan margins and the all‑in financing costs charged for data‑centre projects.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_market_repricing</data>
  <data key="d40">ai_buildout_backlash</data>
