  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained global tightening of monetary policy raises private cost of capital and reduces foreign financing for strategic firms, prompting Chinese authorities to increase coordinated, state‑directed investment to sustain critical tech projects and offset private shortfalls.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_market_repricing</data>
  <data key="d40">china_tech_rivalry</data>
