  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">An increase in expected future short‑term interest rates raises the discount rate for long‑duration tech cash flows and prompts portfolio reallocation toward yield assets, causing net outflows from AI/tech equities.</data>
