  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising market expectations of higher interest rates strengthen the US dollar and tighten dollar liquidity globally, directly increasing the practical reach and enforcement leverage of US financial sanctions and prompting policymakers to deploy or widen sanctions while they are most effective.</data>
